2026-10-26 18:18:39,634 | INFO | TestCase 9: Source [ORACLE]:WITH rollover_excluded_mbrs AS (

  SELECT 
  DISTINCT mp.mbi,
  mp.member_profile_id_nh,
  mp.business_id_nh 
